<title>FRANCE: Axa not interested in GAN - paper.</title>
<headline>Axa not interested in GAN - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Axa-UAP Chairman Claude Bebear said the French insurance giant was not interested in buying state-controlled rival GAN.</p>
<p>Asked in an interview with the financial daily La Tribune Desfosses about whether the group was interested in acquiring GAN, Bebear replied, &quot;Frankly no.&quot;</p>
<p>Axa and UAP last year announced they merging to form the world's second largest insurer.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
